<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tl">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Bias · CISD · FVG Scanner</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0f1519;--pan:#172028;--line:#27333d;--tx:#e7edf2;--mut:#8896a3;--bull:#35c3a4;--bear:#ee7770;--warn:#e6b84c}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);font:15px/1.45 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;padding:14px;max-width:720px;margin-inline:auto}
h1{font-size:19px;margin:4px 0 2px;letter-spacing:.2px}
.sub{color:var(--mut);font-size:13px;margin:0 0 12px}
.bar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}
button{background:var(--tx);color:var(--bg);border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 16px;font:600 14px inherit;font-family:inherit}
button:disabled{opacity:.5}
label{color:var(--mut);font-size:13px;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}
#st{color:var(--mut);font-size:13px;margin:4px 0 12px}
.card{background:var(--pan);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--mut);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:10px}
.card.bull{border-left-color:var(--bull)}.card.bear{border-left-color:var(--bear)}
.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}
.sym{font-weight:700;font-size:16px}
.tag{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:99px}
.bull .tag{background:rgba(53,195,164,.16);color:var(--bull)}
.bear .tag{background:rgba(238,119,112,.16);color:var(--bear)}
.chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:8px 0}
.chip{font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--mut)}
.chip.on{color:var(--tx);border-color:var(--tx)}
.row{font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:4px}
.row b{color:var(--tx);font-weight:600}
.go{color:var(--warn);font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
.empty{color:var(--mut);padding:18px 0;text-align:center}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Bias · CISD · FVG Scanner</h1>
<p class="sub">Weekly + Daily bias → 1H CISD → RGR/GRG sa loob ng FVG (15m o 5m). Top 50 Binance USDT by volume.</p>
<div class="bar">
  <button id="go">Scan na</button>
  <label><input type="checkbox" id="auto"> Auto-scan kada 5 min</label>
